  - m_Id: 166872772608
    m_Localized: '- P or ESC - Pause/Resume


      Aircraft Controls:

      - W/S
      - Ascend/Descend

      - A/D - Bank Left/Right

      - Q/E - Turn Left/Right

      -
      F - Deploy Flares

      - Left-Click - Use Plane''s Active Weapon

      -
      Space - Switch Weapon Type'
